<title>YUGOSLAVIA: SOCCER-YUGOSLAVIA BEAT CZECH REPUBLIC 1-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-YUGOSLAVIA BEAT CZECH REPUBLIC 1-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>BELGRADE 1996-11-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yugoslavia beat the Czech</p>
<p>Republic 1-0 (halftime 1-0) in their World Cup European group</p>
<p>six match qualifier on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scorer: Predrag Mijatovic 18</p>
<p>Attendance 50,000</p>
<p>Group six standings (tabulate - played, won, drawn, lost,</p>
<p>goals for, against, points):</p>
<p> Yugoslavia	   4   4   0   0  18   2  12</p>
<p> Slovakia	     3   3   0   0  11   1   9</p>
<p> Czech Republic     3   1   1   1   6   1   4</p>
<p> Spain		  2   1   1   0   6   2   4</p>
<p> Faroe Islands	5   0   0   5   5  22   0</p>
<p> Malta		  3   0   0   3   0  18   0</p>
<p>Next match: Nov 13 - Spain v Slovakia</p>
</text>
